<title>USA: Novellus sues Applied Materials.</title>
<headline>Novellus sues Applied Materials.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novellus Systems Inc said Monday it has filed a patent infringement suit against Applied Materials Inc.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it filed the lawsuit in the U.S. District Court for the Northern District of California.</p>
<p>Novellus said Applied infringed its patents by its manufacture, use and sale of Endura and Centura PVD (physical vapor deposition) systems. The suit seeks damages for infringing sales and willful infringement, and seeks an injunction against the further manufacture, use and sale of Endura and Centura PVD systems.</p>
<p>The patents asserted by Novellus were recently acquired from Varian Associates Inc, with the acquisition of Varian's Thin Film Systems business.</p>
